("d-cors-preflight", "The preflight response is cached by browsers for ten minutes, so a header change appears not to take effect.",
 "Preflight results are cached client-side. After changing allowed headers, existing browser sessions keep the old answer for the cache duration. Test in a fresh profile before concluding the change did not work."),
("d-graceful-drain", "The load balancer keeps sending traffic for up to 30 seconds after an instance is marked unhealthy, so the drain wait must exceed that.",
 "Deregistration is not immediate. An instance that exits as soon as it is marked unhealthy drops in-flight requests. The shutdown must wait longer than the deregistration delay, which is currently not the case for one service."),
